Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.05,0:01:43.57,Title,0,0,0,0,,《谍影重重》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.11,0:01:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一团乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:02:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前从来没有看过死人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never seen a dead man before?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿张毯子盖着他 把他盖起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a blanket on him. Cover him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我马上到 给他盖上\N{\fnArial\fs30}One minute. I'll be right there. Cover him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.15,0:04:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏黎世戈曼萨银行 000-7-17-12-0-14-26\N{\fnArial\fs30}000-7-17-12-0-14-26 Gemeinschaft Bank Zurich.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.46,0:04:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的对我做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.17,0:05:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！我在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it! Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.51,0:05:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘渔船！你当时在水里\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boat! A fishing boat. You were in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,被捞上船的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pulled you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么水里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What water?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你中弹了 看见了吗？这是子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were shot. See? There are the bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 有个银行帐号 为什么它在你的屁股里面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there is a number for a bank. Why was it in your hip?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的屁股？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hip?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.79,0:05:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么在你的屁股里面？- 我的屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why was it in your hip? - My hip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.62,0:05:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 在你屁股皮肤下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, in your hip under the skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要把我怎样？- 你需要休息 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing with me? - You need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.00,0:05:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,请躺下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.09,0:05:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有恶意 我是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a friend. I'm your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.01,0:05:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫姜卡洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Giancarlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.55,0:05:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 天哪 - 躺下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God. - Lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.53,0:05:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗吉尼亚州 兰利 中央情报局总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}CENTRAL INTELLIGENCE AGENCY LANGLEY, VIRGINIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.01,0:06:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 已得到确认 任务失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been confirmed, sir. Mission failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.31,0:07:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.73,0:07:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果知道我是谁…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you know who I am…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.87,0:07:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就请不要胡闹了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please stop messing around…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.95,0:07:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吃的话就请过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to eat, get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.59,0:07:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这些海图来看 我可能去过离海岸更近的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on these charts, I think I may have been closer to the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.43,0:07:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？你系的这些结？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? You tie these knots?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.52,0:07:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开始恢复记忆了？- 不 还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, it starts to come back? - No, it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.85,0:07:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绳结没什么特别 我只是打个结\N{\fnArial\fs30}The knot's like everything else. I found the rope and I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我能阅读\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same way I can read.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能写字 做算术 煮咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can write. I can add, subtract. I can make coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:08:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洗扑克牌 摆棋盘 - 你的记忆肯定能恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can shuffle cards, play chess. - Yes, it will come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 恢复不了 真见鬼！问题就出在这！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not coming back, goddamn it! That's the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.99,0:08:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在这儿查看这些…鬼东西！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm down here looking through this, all this shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已在这呆了两星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}For two weeks I'm down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不顶用 我甚至不知道要查找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working. I don't even know what to look for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要休息 记忆会恢复的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to rest. It will come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不恢复怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it doesn't come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.85,0:08:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天就到港口了 我却连名字都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get in there tomorrow, I don't even have a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.01,0:09:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不多 但应该够你去瑞士了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not much, but it should get you to Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.43,0:09:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不认识这些标识吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you read the signs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.78,0:10:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来…快点 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your feet…let's go…right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,公园关门了 不许在公园过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The park is cIosed. There's no sleeping in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:10:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.50,0:11:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看一下你的证件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see some identification.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拿证件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on…your papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么证件也没有 我失去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any papers. I lost my…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.88,0:11:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去它们了…我的证件 都丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost them…my papers…they are lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.05,0:11:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 跟我们走 举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok…let's go…put your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.89,0:11:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想睡…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I just need to sleep…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人威胁我的家人 我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people have threatened my family. My babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以听好了 一旦证据齐全…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm telling you, when the evidence is clear…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就有好戏让大家看\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I will have a nice story for you to read about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我那边的朋友 你们会看到好戏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all my friends out there, you will read about yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.05,0:11:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在我变得理智后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to play this game…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们若还想玩这场游戏 我就演给你们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}…after I have been reasonable, I will show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.35,0:12:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是尼瓦纳·翁博希前天在巴黎的讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Nykwana Wombosi speaking in Paris the day before yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他掌权前就是个刺头 执政时则是个麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was an irritation before he took power, a probIem…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,流亡后已成为我们的灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when he was in power, and he's been a disaster for us in exile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.81,0:12:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在写书 讲中情局在非洲的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's writing a book about the Agency's history in Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.44,0:12:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要点特工的名\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to name names.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直是敲诈 他在强求中情局的援助\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's basically a shaedown. He's demanding the Agency's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想让我们在六个月内扶他重新上台 否则就等着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants us to put him back in power in six months, or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把这次采访的磁带给需要者\N{\fnArial\fs30}This interview, and I'll make the tape availabIe to whoever wants it…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.66,0:12:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在采访时还称自己刚躲过暗杀企图\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he goes on to claim that he's just survived an assassination attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说是我们干的 称自己有证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says it's us. He says he's got proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,局长想知道这一指控…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Director wants to know if there's any truth…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.80,0:12:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可有真实之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in this accusation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.05,0:12:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已向他保证我的高级幕僚中没人会这么鲁莽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already assured him there's nobody that recless on my senior staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起了我们以前的一次谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was recalling a conversation we had some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.94,0:12:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于「踩石」行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taling about Treadstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我似乎记得谈话中提到过翁博希的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seem to remember Wombosi's name might have come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.90,0:12:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢肯定我们谈了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure what we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:12:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人试图把他干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone tried to take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却失手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tried and failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.54,0:13:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是踩石行动？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was this Treadstone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在直截了当地提问？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're asking me a direct question?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.29,0:13:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were never gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.09,0:13:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们与我们的人失去了联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we lost the communication with our man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.01,0:13:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几乎是两周前的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was almost two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.97,0:13:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们整个小组没日没夜一直在干\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've worked around the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.56,0:13:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们睡在那儿 想方设法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been sleeping down there. We're doing everything we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.94,0:13:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你不想让我知道这事？- 你以前从不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you don't let me know this? - You never wanted to before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.23,0:13:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前从没失过手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never made a mistake before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞士苏黎世 戈曼萨银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}GEMEINSCHAFT BANK ZURICH SWITZERLAND.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.89,0:14:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能为你效劳吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.06,0:14:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来办理保险箱帐户的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm here about a numbered account.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把帐号填在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you just enter your account number here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就叫人帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll direct you to an appropriate officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.97,0:16:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,美利坚合众国护照\N{\fnArial\fs30}PASSPORT United States of America.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.11,0:16:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫杰森·伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.32,0:16:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,住在巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to think…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我上次来这里有多久了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long's it been since I was here last?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.55,0:18:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有三星期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.94,0:18:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.57,0:18:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有杰森·伯恩的电话号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have the number for a Jason Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的 先生 需要给你接通吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Would you lie me to connect you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.24,0:18:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,请接通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.12,0:18:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是46990384\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is 46990384.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,请在听到信号声后留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave a message at the beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.52,0:19:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国公民\N{\fnArial\fs30}U.S. Citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an American.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.20,0:19:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.95,0:19:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这没有管辖权\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've no jurisdiction here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.16,0:19:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在外边 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it there. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.92,0:20:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 这不是我现在住址 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. No. This is not my current address, oay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.71,0:20:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在我两天前开始排队时还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was my address until two days ago, when I started standing in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.67,0:20:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在已没有公寓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I lose my apartment, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.05,0:20:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着没有住址 电话 钱 时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means no address, no phone, no money, no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.97,0:20:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而我还没拿到签证？- 库鲁茨小姐 请冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I still have no visa! - Miss Kreutz, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.43,0:20:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须请你放低声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must ask you to keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 但上周与我谈话的那家伙在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. But where's the guy that I talked to last week?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,每周都换新人 凭什么要我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every week it's a new person. How am I supposed to…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.44,0:20:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你上周见的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who you saw last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.27,0:20:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 我帮你找 确信有他名字 - 请稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me help you. I'm sure I have it. - Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.03,0:20:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能听我说吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I have your attention for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.24,0:20:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿找到了 你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have it right here. Just look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在费尽心思地躲避美国的移民法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You staged an effort to circumvent the immigration Iaws of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.37,0:20:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前这是学生签证\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a student visa now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.96,0:20:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已和绿卡无关 完全不是一回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about a green card anymore. It's very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.17,0:20:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 库鲁茨小姐 这不是菜单 你不… - 我把所有证明都带来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not a menu. You don't just… - I brought all this proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.25,0:20:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,疑犯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Potential suspect…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.63,0:20:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是袭击案的同案犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help in assauIt incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.55,0:21:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,红口袋！拿红口袋那个人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You! Red bag! The red bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在原地不动！举起手来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop right there! Put your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.81,0:21:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正赶过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it! Now! Now! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.99,0:21:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一队从后面楼梯往上冲 二队…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha Unit, tae the bac stairs and wor your way up. Bravo…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.16,0:22:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,疏散方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}EVACUATION PLAN.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.87,0:22:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,上！快上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move in! Move in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 没人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.67,0:22:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,疑犯是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suspect is…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.88,0:22:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,二队正在上楼 即将到达二楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving up staircase. Proceeding to second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.01,0:22:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一队 你们可以上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha Unit, you're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.52,0:22:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.69,0:22:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一队 二队 目标也许有对讲机\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Units, target may have a radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.32,0:22:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,用代码77 通话结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to Code 77. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.53,0:22:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,代码77 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code 77, copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.70,0:22:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴在地板上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The floor! Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.99,0:22:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.54,0:22:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险 请勿打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}DANGER DO NOT OPEN.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.89,0:23:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,请勿进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}DO NOT ENTER.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.21,0:24:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 往前挪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Move up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.69,0:25:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他现在在苏黎世？现在？- 是的 刚收到消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's in Zurich now? Right now? - Yes. It just came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.18,0:25:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们确信是他吗？- 是的 他去了银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're sure it's him? - Yes. He went to the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.49,0:25:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们在银行的线人汇报的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our source at the bank, that's who called.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.45,0:25:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.37,0:25:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定会想到我们在监视银行 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's got to assume we're watching the bank, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.87,0:25:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 快开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.12,0:25:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说他清空保险箱却留下枪 是何意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he cleaned out the box. He left a gun. What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.67,0:25:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 我不知道！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.38,0:25:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更喜欢认为他已死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I Iiked it better when I thought he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.14,0:25:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.48,0:26:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在里面听你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.06,0:26:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.02,0:26:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了你在领事馆说的话 我想我们或许可以相互帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The consulate. I heard you talking. I thought maybe we could help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.82,0:26:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么帮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.20,0:26:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要钱 我需要坐车离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need money. I need a ride out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.91,0:26:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 我不提供租车业务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not running a car service. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.91,0:26:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你一万美元开车送我去巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you $10, 000 to drive me to Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.21,0:26:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你以为我是傻子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do you think I'm a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.17,0:26:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不干就是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be a fool not to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.92,0:26:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是开玩笑？还是什么骗局？- 这不是骗局\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this a joke? Some kind of scam? - No, it's no scam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.59,0:26:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,到后我会另付你一万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you another $10, 000 when we arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.72,0:26:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.27,0:26:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是抓你的吗？- 听好 你开车我付钱 就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that for you? - Look. You drive, I pay. It's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.44,0:26:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我麻烦已够多的了 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got enough troubIe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.11,0:26:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.11,0:26:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以要回钱吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have my money back?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.59,0:27:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 继续往下放\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, go. Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.39,0:27:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.10,0:27:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这！等等？- 不 应该是快结束的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There! Wait! - No, it's got to be near the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.56,0:27:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,弟兄们 我们撞大运了！开始干吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, folks! We caught a break here! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.64,0:27:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.89,0:27:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到坐标了 飞机 火车 宾馆 医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting grids. Airline, train, hotels, hospitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.98,0:27:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁查到了地址？街道名？戈门萨德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's getting the address? The street? Gemensheidt.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.57,0:27:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看好了 - 我找到了 我想我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here we go. - I think I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.82,0:27:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.40,0:27:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是实时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.82,0:27:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是38分钟前的镜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is 38 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.49,0:27:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏黎世警方正搜查一个拿红口袋的美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zurich police are looking for an American carrying a red bank bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.29,0:27:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚大闹了使馆 昨晚还把两名警察「送进」了医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just tore up the embassy and put two cops in the hospital last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.67,0:27:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有人都激活 马上 我要他们都行动起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get everybody up. Do it now. I want them all activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.92,0:27:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 激活所有人？同时？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. All of them? At the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.80,0:27:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我要伯恩在日落前躺在尸体袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me. I want Bourne in a body bag by sundown.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.51,0:27:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 在这贴张地图！快点 弟兄们！我们来安排好这些！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's get a map up here! Come on, folks! Let's work it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.18,0:27:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,口令：XX9897 待命外派特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}PASSWORD: XX9897 AVAILABLE AGENTS IN LOCATION.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.52,0:28:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐标正在更新\N{\fnArial\fs30}The grids are getting updated.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.27,0:28:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,代号：教授 893489 黑猩猩已启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}CODE: PROFESSOR 893489CHIMP INITIATED.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.61,0:28:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}LOCATING.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.61,0:28:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,位于：巴塞罗那\N{\fnArial\fs30}LOCATED: BARCELONA.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.65,0:28:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,登录已被接受 键入命令：回车\N{\fnArial\fs30}ENTRANCE ACCEPTED TYPE COMMAND: ENTER.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.70,0:28:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,连接中\N{\fnArial\fs30}CONNECTING.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.99,0:28:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备模式 准备投放武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}PREP MODE AND ARM READY FOR TRANSPORT.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.37,0:28:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,原地待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}HOLD PATTERN UNTIL FURTHER NOTICE.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.99,0:28:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,发送\N{\fnArial\fs30}SENDING.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.12,0:28:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备模式 武器已可随时投放\N{\fnArial\fs30}PREP MODE AND ARM READY FOR TRANSPORT.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.13,0:28:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}HAMBURG.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.21,0:28:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,激活代号：曼海姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}ACTIVATION CODE: MANHEIM.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.71,0:28:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备模式 武器投放苏黎世\N{\fnArial\fs30}PREP MODE AND ARMlTRANSPORT ZURICH.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.47,0:28:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,智利护照 / 立即派发 432ZZ45\N{\fnArial\fs30}PASSPORT CHILElIMMEDIATE DISPATCH 432ZZ45.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.34,0:28:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁定目的地苏黎世 发送\N{\fnArial\fs30}HOLD DESTINATION ZURICH SENDING.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.56,0:28:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,地点：罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}LOCATION: ROME.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.74,0:28:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}CASTEL.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.07,0:28:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,连接中 地点：意大利罗马 信号传送已确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}CONNECTING LOCATION: ROME ITALY TRANSMISSION CONFIRMED.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.74,0:28:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,地点：意大利罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}LOCATION: ROME ITALY.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.39,0:29:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我来说没什么 因为我已有准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which was fine with me because I was ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.76,0:29:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便在阿姆斯特丹呆六个月也不确信…\N{\fnArial\fs30}After six months in Amsterdam, you're not sure…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.43,0:29:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在那呆了20分钟还是20年 你知道我的意思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you've been there 20 minutes or years, you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.65,0:29:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我带着钱离开那 加入朋友一起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I went. I took all the money I had. I went in with friends…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.11,0:29:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,接手了法国比亚里兹郊外的 一个很棒的冲浪商店\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we took over this really cool surf shop outside Biarritz,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.82,0:29:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它紧挨着海边\N{\fnArial\fs30}right by the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.79,0:29:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那简直太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.78,0:29:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那三个月实在是太好了 直到后来发现…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just amazing for about three months, until it turned out that this…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.95,0:29:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把商店预租给我们的那个蠢蛋实际上骗了我们 而且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…jerk who had fronted us the lease was actually shining everyone on and…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.21,0:29:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.30,0:29:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「怎样」是什么意思？你听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean "what"? Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.30,0:29:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直不停地说了快60公里的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been speed-talking for about 60 kilometers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.97,0:30:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一紧张就要说…我说这些是因为我紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talk when I'm nervous. I mean, I talk like this when I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.31,0:30:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要闭嘴不说了 - 别那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna shut up now. - No, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.14,0:30:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已有段时间没和人说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't talked to anybody in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.90,0:30:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但我们没有说话 就我在说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we're not talking. I'm talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.73,0:30:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,自离开苏黎世后 你说了有十个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've said, like, 10 words since we left Zurich.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.65,0:30:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 听你说是一种休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, listening to you, it's relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.83,0:30:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一阵没睡觉了 而且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't slept in a while and…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.08,0:30:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还遇上这头疼的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've had this headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.29,0:30:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像在脑子里不停地运转…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a constant thing in my head…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.50,0:30:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且刚开始触及背景…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and it's just starting to move to the background…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.84,0:30:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此接着说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.71,0:30:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 如果你愿意 就请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, if you want, please keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.84,0:30:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.06,0:30:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢什么样的音乐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of music do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.69,0:30:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢什么样的？说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you like? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.86,0:30:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还是算了吧 - 不 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what? Never mind. - No, it's fine. Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.65,0:30:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想听什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to listen to?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.03,0:30:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.03,0:31:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 这没什么好难的 你喜欢什么？告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, it's not that hard. What do you like? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.83,0:31:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.75,0:31:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会付两万美元坐车去巴黎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who pays $20, 000 for a ride to Paris?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.56,0:31:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.73,0:31:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,两周前发生的事 我什么也记不起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't remember anything that happened before two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.57,0:31:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真幸运 - 不 我是说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lucky you. - No, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.90,0:31:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我是谁 我不知道我要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who I am. I don't know where I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.78,0:31:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,全不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.24,0:31:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？像健忘症？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? Like amnesia? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.41,0:31:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 健忘症 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amnesia. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.25,0:31:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.59,0:32:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是观察该庭院的最好角度？- 是唯一角度\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that's the best angle of the courtyard? - That's the only angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.47,0:32:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在这些街道或这一地区有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they have of the streets? Or, you know, the area?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.60,0:32:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must have something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.93,0:32:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.48,0:32:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.61,0:32:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩游戏？警告我们？威胁我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it a game? Is he warning us? Is it a threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.65,0:32:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir? Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.45,0:32:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是哪？- 某个角度观察到的那条街\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - It's an angle of the street, a sort of alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.49,0:32:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,增强信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just enhance it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.58,0:32:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.46,0:32:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽·库鲁茨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marie Helena Kreutz.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.30,0:32:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,26岁 出生在汉诺威 她父亲是焊接工\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's 26, born outside Hanover. Her father was a welder.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.59,0:32:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,死于87年\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died in '87.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.14,0:32:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没她母亲的资料 她祖母仍住在汉诺威\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still don't have the mother. The grandmother, she's still in Hanover.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.97,0:32:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来她成了这场家庭小灾难中的依靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like she's the anchor for this little domestic disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.60,0:32:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个同母异父的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's a stepbrother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.27,0:32:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦的是 她是「吉普赛人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tough. The girl's a gypsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.36,0:33:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指她四处出现 但充其量也就是乱跑而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she pops up on the grid here and there, but it's chaotic at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.03,0:33:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,95年时 她在西班牙付过电费\N{\fnArial\fs30}She paid some electric bilIs in Spain, '95.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.53,0:33:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,96年在比利时 有三个月用自己的名字作户主安装过电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had a phone in her name for three months in Belgium, '96.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.12,0:33:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有纳税和贷款记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}No taxes, no credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.62,0:33:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这人 我要你们深入调查她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like her. I want to go deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.04,0:33:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,查她祖母和那半个弟弟的电话记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a phone log for Granny and the half-brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.96,0:33:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,查与她有关的任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody we can cross-file.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.17,0:33:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道她过去六年都呆过哪些地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to now every place she's slept in the past six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.46,0:33:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫巴黎方面把这些印出来给外勤人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have Paris get these out in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.30,0:33:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国巴黎 踩石行动密点\N{\fnArial\fs30}TREADSTONE SAFE HOUSE PARIS, FRANCE.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.04,0:33:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有编故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not maing this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.33,0:33:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.92,0:34:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.05,0:34:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的银行保险箱里会装满了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who has a safety deposit box full of…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.26,0:34:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱 六本护照 还有一把枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…money and six passports and a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.06,0:34:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会把银行帐号藏在屁股？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who has a bank account number in their hip?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.27,0:34:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进来后做的第一件事 就是全面观察…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come in here, and the first thing I'm doing is I'm catching the sightlines…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.57,0:34:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and looking for an exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.90,0:34:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也看见出口标志了 但我不担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the exit sign, too. I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.11,0:34:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你遭枪击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you were shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.91,0:34:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,人在惊吓状态下会做出反常的事来\N{\fnArial\fs30}People do all inds of weird and amazing stuff when they are scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.08,0:34:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你…门外六辆车的牌号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell you the license plate numbers of all six cars outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.92,0:34:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你…女服务员是左撇子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that our waitress is left-handed…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.55,0:34:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有坐在柜台边那小子重98公斤 他还没喝多\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the guy sitting at the counter weighs 215 pounds and can handle himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.93,0:34:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道要想找枪的最佳地点…是那辆灰色卡车的驾驶室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I now the best place to loo for a gun is the cab of the gray truc outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.77,0:34:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在目前的海拔高度\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this altitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.45,0:35:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以全速跑上八百米而手不发抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can run flat out for a half-mile before my hands start shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.27,0:35:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么会知道这些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now why would I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.82,0:35:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎能知道这些 却不知自己是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I know that and not know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.86,0:35:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴黎103 里尔350\N{\fnArial\fs30}PARIS 103 LILLE 350.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.82,0:35:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.45,0:35:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.04,0:36:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 简直不敢相信 - 你太困了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't believe it. - Yeah, well, you were tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.54,0:36:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直没睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.00,0:36:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 到了 为两万美元的缘故 我免费赠送早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, here. For $20, 000, I like to throw in breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.30,0:36:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你停车加过油吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you stop for gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.01,0:36:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睡得跟死猪一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were pretty out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.02,0:36:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这儿有家人在等着你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, do you think there's, Iike, a family waiting for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.65,0:36:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.69,0:36:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.29,0:36:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.21,0:36:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,104号\N{\fnArial\fs30}104.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.12,0:36:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 地址是这 别停 继续开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's the address. No, keep going. Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.00,0:36:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 怎么走？- 左拐 停这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. Where? - Just take a left. Pull in over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.92,0:36:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.60,0:37:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 是这里了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.56,0:37:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.11,0:37:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 这里我一点也认不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I don't recognize any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.90,0:37:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.95,0:37:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.54,0:37:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 钱 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. The money. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.96,0:37:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.92,0:37:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.42,0:37:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.97,0:37:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你开车送我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.43,0:37:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时恭候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.14,0:37:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以一块上去 或在这等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you could come up. I mean, or you can wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.06,0:37:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去查查 你在这等 - 哦…不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can go check it out. But you could wait. - Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.65,0:37:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以等\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.44,0:37:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这等的话 你很可能会把我忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you, you would probably just forget about me if I stayed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.07,0:37:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么可能忘了你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I forget about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.16,0:38:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我唯一认识的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only person I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.29,0:38:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那倒是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.68,0:38:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你不在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you're not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.53,0:38:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩先生 你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Bourne, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.61,0:38:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩先生 我还在想…好久没见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Bourne, I was wondering… I haven't seen you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.20,0:38:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.66,0:38:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我忘带钥匙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I forgot my key.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.97,0:39:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.44,0:39:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确信这些全是你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure this is all yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.87,0:39:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.09,0:39:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的厨房\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.96,0:40:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有线索吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any clues?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.96,0:40:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我是干航运的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm in the shipping business.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.59,0:40:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你开始回忆起来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's all coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.63,0:40:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以用一下卫生间吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if I use the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.93,0:40:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.97,0:40:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.13,0:40:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.79,0:41:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 巴黎女王饭店 请问转哪个分机？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, Hotel Regina, Paris. How may I direct your call?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.34,0:41:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们是在巴黎？- 是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, you're in Paris? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.63,0:41:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找你们饭店的一位客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for a guest there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.14,0:41:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫杰森·伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.06,0:41:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请稍候 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One moment, please. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.65,0:41:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 很抱歉 没有人以该名字入住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I have no one by that name registered.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.07,0:41:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.86,0:41:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！别挂！喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! No, no. Are you there? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.24,0:41:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,请讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.11,0:41:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮我查另外一个人名吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you check another name for me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.49,0:41:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,请稍等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, bear with me one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.58,0:41:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·凯恩 凯旋的凯 请稍候\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Kane. Kane with a "K." One moment, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.21,0:41:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.89,0:41:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是找凯恩先生？约翰·凯恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call about Monsieur Kane? John Michael Kane?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.18,0:41:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.89,0:41:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是他的朋友？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are a friend of his? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.52,0:42:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我要告诉你个坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have some very bad news for you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.90,0:42:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to tell you this,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.97,0:42:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯恩先生大约两周前去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Monsieur Kane has passed away almost two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.86,0:42:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他发生了意外 是在高速公路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was an accident. On the motorway.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.70,0:42:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他显然当场就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, he was illed instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.20,0:42:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉 告诉你这消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, I'm terribly sorry to be the one to tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.87,0:42:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吧 我们是在他们来收拾…他的东西时 得知此事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they came for his things, it was made nown for us, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.75,0:42:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who came?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.21,0:42:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}His brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.13,0:42:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他兄弟留下电话号码或联系方式了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did his brother leave a number or a way to get in touch with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.09,0:42:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.72,0:42:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.16,0:42:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森？没有热水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason? There's no hot water.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.79,0:42:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,水冰凉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.29,0:43:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去试试厨房里的水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go try the water in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.63,0:43:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不就呆在卫生间？我去看看能否把水放热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just stay in the bathroom? I'll see if I can get it hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.26,0:43:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的水也冰凉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's really cold in here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.94,0:43:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,水还是凉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The water is still cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.99,0:43:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 厨房里的也是 尽管我已放水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's cold in the kitchen, too. I got it running, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.29,0:43:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.38,0:43:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.13,0:43:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.97,0:43:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.55,0:43:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.98,0:44:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.65,0:44:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.40,0:44:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.42,0:45:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它打开 告诉我里面是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open that. Tell me what's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.97,0:45:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.01,0:45:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.31,0:46:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.23,0:46:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有武器 且危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}ARMED AND DANGEROUS.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.60,0:46:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.15,0:46:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.73,0:46:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回答！你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer me! Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.99,0:46:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他有我的照片？- 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's got my picture! - All right. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.57,0:46:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是苏黎世 是昨天的？- 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is Zurich, yesterday! - Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.95,0:46:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白你从哪弄的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.70,0:46:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住 你是怎么拿到照片的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay there. How did you get my picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.37,0:46:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪弄来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get this from?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.62,0:46:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么弄来我的…我的天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get my… My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.62,0:46:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来处理！你呆在原地 呆在那！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do this! You stay there. Stay there!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.98,0:46:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的鞋在哪？把鞋穿上 - 好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are your shoes? Get your shoes. - Sure. Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.23,0:46:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跳下窗户了 为何会有人这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went out the window. Why would someone do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.90,0:46:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能呆这了 这不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stay here. It's not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.40,0:47:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以逃出去 但必须马上走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get us out of here, but we got to go. We got to go right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.04,0:47:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你可以留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, you can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.58,0:47:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以留下等警察来 不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can wait for the cops. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.17,0:47:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等他们来就是了 但我不能 我必须离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just wait for them to get here. But I can't. I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.59,0:47:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.01,0:47:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.68,0:47:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吭声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet. Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.05,0:47:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.92,0:47:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,请报代号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code in.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.88,0:47:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔法 37509\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha 37509.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.76,0:48:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.89,0:48:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.73,0:48:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是伯恩 他去巴黎了 去了公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne went to Paris, to the apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.10,0:48:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓到他了？说 - 他杀了我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got him? Tell me. - He killed our man.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.82,0:48:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？在公寓里？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? In the apartment? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.98,0:48:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你必须把这事摆平 - 不行 我没法摆平\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you got to clean that up. - No, I can't clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.49,0:48:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尸体在街上 - 那又怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's a body in the street. - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.57,0:48:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,街上有警察 这是巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's police. This is Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.45,0:48:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,监听警方通讯 尽可能地截获信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put up the scanners. Get as much radio information as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.41,0:48:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呆在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.50,0:48:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找地方把钱存上 十分钟后回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go find a place for this money. I'll be back in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.75,0:50:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我告诉过你呆在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I told you to stay in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.89,0:50:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 我叫你呆在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ. I told you to stay in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.39,0:50:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去喝了点东西 我以为你不回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed a drink. I didn't think you would come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.19,0:50:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你必须去报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you got to go to the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.06,0:50:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上去 赶在事情变得更糟以前去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now. You got to go before this gets any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.52,0:50:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就我自己？- 不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By myself? - It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.40,0:50:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我的护照带上 给警察看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna take my passport, okay? You show this to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.40,0:50:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有那张照片 还有这两万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have that picture, you have the $20, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.74,0:50:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有事都告诉警察 他们会相信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell them everything that happened. They'll believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.66,0:50:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只能相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have to believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.58,0:50:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 你不能只是坐在这里 这不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marie, you can't just sit here. It's not safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.50,0:50:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全？这一切都起始于使馆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe? This is from inside the embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.67,0:50:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁能干这些事？- 我不知道 - 从昨天起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who can do this? - I don't know. - This is from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.51,0:50:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们怎能知道我们在一起？- 我这么做 是为你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How can they know we're together? - I'm trying to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.55,0:50:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.47,0:50:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我好？你把我独自交给警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'll you make this right by sending me there alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.14,0:50:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能为我好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I want you to go to the cops? That's good?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.64,0:50:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想去 那好 你去我就得逃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go, fine. If you go, I run!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.69,0:50:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去说清情况？- 我不清楚到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You tell them what happened! - I don't know what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.56,0:51:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知那家伙是谁 以及照片的来历\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who this guy was or about that picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.98,0:51:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知我是谁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.57,0:51:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.74,0:51:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你表现得就像是我要害你 我是怕做错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm trying to burn you. I'm trying to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.12,0:51:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能做对的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody does the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.34,0:51:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 我不能带着你逃亡 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I can't run with you. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.68,0:51:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起就得像这么生活 我得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We run, I got to live like this. I got to…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.27,0:51:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不知道我在躲谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know who I'm hiding from.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.14,0:51:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这帮人知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.02,0:51:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须留在这里 我得查明真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got to stay here. I got to figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.52,0:51:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就查明真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}So figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.50,0:52:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来开车？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take care of this car?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.71,0:52:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.92,0:52:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在来的路上 我觉得车胎有点没气\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tires feIt a little splashy on the way over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.84,0:52:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,车开起来有点往右偏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It pulIs a little to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.57,0:52:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last chance, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.16,0:53:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.53,0:54:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我们就要颠簸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - We got a bump coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.61,0:54:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把头转开 把头转开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn your head away. Turn your head away.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.50,0:56:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远不能回这车上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can never come back to this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.08,0:56:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.84,0:56:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们要把它擦干净 我来抹去指纹 然后我们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're gonna clean it out, and I'll wipe it down, and we walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.22,0:56:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这样 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.93,0:57:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找个地方供我们休息 而且 我得理清头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. And I'll find a place for us to rest. And I got to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.76,0:57:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有帽子或头巾什么的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a hat or a scarf or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.06,0:57:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 盖住我的头发？- 对 直到换发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For my hair? - Yeah. Just until we can change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.68,0:57:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 那当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sure. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.56,0:57:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.27,0:57:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国巴黎 霍芬曼陈尸所\N{\fnArial\fs30}HOFFENMEIn MORGUE PARlS, FRANCE.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.60,0:57:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.94,0:57:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人没中弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man was not shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.50,0:58:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何消息？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.00,0:58:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,翁博希去了陈尸所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wombosi went to the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.25,0:58:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看了尸体 他不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw the body. He didn't buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.18,0:58:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.84,0:58:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我人手不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I'm not staffed for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.10,0:58:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪？翁博希现在在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he? Right now! Where's Wombosi?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.47,0:58:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚离开陈尸所\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were leaving the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.85,0:58:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.44,0:58:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 你看怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.71,1:00:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拿瓶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to get the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.92,1:02:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.26,1:02:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已打扫了房间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already cleaned the room?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.35,1:02:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把所有地方的指纹都擦去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wiped the whole place down for fingerprints.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.73,1:02:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以走动吗？会留下脚印吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I walk around or is it gonna leave any footprints?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.62,1:02:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以走 这没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can walk around. It's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.79,1:02:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我们要记住碰过哪些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll just keep track of everything we touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.54,1:02:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开房间时 不能留下任何痕迹 我想这样会更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's best if we leave a room, that we don't leave a trail.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.33,1:02:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何？我们去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.92,1:02:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去约翰·凯恩住过的饭店\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to go to the hotel where John Michael Kane stayed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.76,1:02:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王饭店\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hotel Regina.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.55,1:03:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我就是他 那他们就会有入住记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I was him, then they're gonna have some records.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.43,1:03:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要饭店的帐单\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need that hotel bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.31,1:03:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.77,1:03:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 这变得有点复杂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gets slightly complicated, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.31,1:03:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.94,1:03:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.86,1:03:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 求你别这样 - 他们想打仗 我们就给他们仗打\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, Please. - They want war, we'll make war.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.03,1:03:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想杀我 最好一上来就把我杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they want to kill me, they better kill me the first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.62,1:03:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们最好把我杀死 最好在我睡觉时把我杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They better kill me dead. They better kill me when I'm in my sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.12,1:03:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 尼瓦纳 我们需要这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. We need these people.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.58,1:03:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要找到能帮我们的人 本身就够难的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard enough getting people that we know to help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.34,1:03:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要谨慎\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.84,1:03:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.59,1:03:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.71,1:03:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把那混蛋小子的头给我带回来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to bring me back that bastard kid's head…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.09,1:03:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在这所房子前面 向他们展示我们从事的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}…put it in front of this house, and show them the war we're fighting.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.22,1:03:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那正好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that is precisely…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.86,1:03:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼瓦纳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nykwana!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.74,1:04:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,动身前 我们要核对一下表\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll give the watch a reference check before we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.95,1:04:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.46,1:04:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个公用电话的号码是多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the pay phone number?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.13,1:04:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,616-2468\N{\fnArial\fs30}616-2468.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.46,1:04:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,出口呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exits?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.84,1:04:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's three.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.30,1:04:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面是内部人员出口 側面出口通向布满店铺的街道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Service at the back, side goes to the street past the shops…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.85,1:04:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面的是最佳出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}…front is the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.76,1:04:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我认为我被人跟踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I think I'm being followed,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.66,1:04:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出来时 就把包挎在右肩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I walk out with the bag over my right shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.73,1:04:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是没出租车怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if there's no taxi?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.31,1:04:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就一直往前走 不要回头看 直到你和我联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep on walking, don't look back until you make contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.15,1:04:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.57,1:04:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真需要这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need this, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.20,1:04:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.05,1:05:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要离你远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need distances.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.59,1:05:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走进去选个位置 要靠近大堂中央\N{\fnArial\fs30}You walk in, you pick a spot. Some midpoint in the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.47,1:05:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要数清并记住走到那个位置的步数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count your steps to that spot, and then remember that number.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.06,1:05:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我给你打电话后 你要赶快行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because after I call you, I can get you moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.64,1:05:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.81,1:05:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要数人数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also need a head count.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.23,1:05:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走到柜台这段时间 弄清有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people from when you walk in until you get to the desk.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.27,1:05:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有多少职员？当然还有保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many hotel employees are there? And obviously security.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.24,1:05:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过要认出他们 或许没那么容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it might not be that easy to see who they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.49,1:05:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给你打电话 你告诉我那的布局 我们就从那开始干\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll call you, you give me the layout, and we'll take it from there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.58,1:05:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王饭店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hotel Regina.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.79,1:05:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,请转大堂公用电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, the house phone in the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.52,1:05:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - l…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.27,1:06:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出差错了？- 我拿到了记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did something go wrong? - I've got the records.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.61,1:06:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,前台那个小伙当时朝我微笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, this guy at the front desk was smiling at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.40,1:06:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此想到所有那些麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I thought, you know, all this trouble,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.46,1:06:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许直接找他会更容易一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe it's easier to just ask for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.70,1:06:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你拿到了帐单？- 他给我复印了一份\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have the bill? - He made me a photocopy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.99,1:06:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你直接要的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just asked for it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.33,1:06:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我是凯恩先生的私人助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I was Mr. Kane's personal assistant.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.17,1:06:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,想得真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. That's good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.77,1:06:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官 要我… - 不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, can l… - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.44,1:06:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,翁博希在他巴黎市中心的寓所被暗杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wombosi was assassinated in his house in the middle of Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.11,1:06:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们刚听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we just heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.61,1:06:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是伯恩干的 我们几乎可以断定是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him. It's Bourne. We're almost positive.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.87,1:06:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被分派了任务 但却失手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had an assignment. He failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.24,1:06:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 他觉得自己必须完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}He obviously feIt compelled to finish the task.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.37,1:07:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.33,1:07:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为 他现在就会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think he'll come back in now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.79,1:07:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说程序如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's routine.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.54,1:07:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就像是行为软件\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like behavioral software.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.13,1:07:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会照章行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's following a protocol.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.55,1:07:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然他已完成任务 我们认为 他就会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that he's completed the mission, we think he'll come back in.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.39,1:07:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们总是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They always do.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.81,1:07:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,何时回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.22,1:07:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回来报到还要多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long till he checks in?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.60,1:07:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 24小时 - 24小时？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 24 hours. - 24?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.65,1:07:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 通常要这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's usually something like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.07,1:07:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.65,1:07:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 我们会把这事摆平\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you we'd clean this up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.91,1:07:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,会摆平的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.04,1:07:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是家潜水用品店 不过 你们店在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you're a dive shop, but where are you located?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.83,1:07:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,马赛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marseilles?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.86,1:08:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们公司具体提供些什么产品？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What specifically does your company supply?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.15,1:08:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 先生 你说你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry. What is your name, monsieur?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.37,1:08:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这呆了三小时 却没找到一个指纹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been here for three hours and you still can't find a print?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.43,1:08:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事？- 巴黎警察找到车子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Paris police found the vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.44,1:08:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已拨通联合保安公司海事部…西蒙·罗林斯的办公室电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've reached Simon Rawlins at Alliance Security, Maritime Division.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.07,1:08:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在巴黎的办公时间是早八点至下午五点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paris office hours are from 8.:00 a.m. to 5.:00 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.08,1:09:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在巴黎找到一个线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a lead in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.54,1:09:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两个英国南安普敦的 其余都是马赛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest were Marseilles, and two out in Southampton.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.29,1:09:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有巴黎的？是谁？- 联合保安公司 西蒙·罗林斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Paris? It's what? - Alliance Security. Simon Rawlins.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.92,1:09:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是留言电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a machine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.53,1:09:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯恩先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kane?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.78,1:09:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯恩先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kane!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.57,1:09:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？- 我还可以 你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you? - I'm good. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.41,1:09:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯恩先生 请进来 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kane. Come right in. Please have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.58,1:09:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.38,1:09:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 这是帕尔默三层甲板游艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is the Palmer Johnson tri-deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.96,1:09:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你还是想买同一艘船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm assuming you're still in the market. It's still the same vessel?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.68,1:10:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.70,1:10:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是凯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.83,1:10:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚作为凯恩开了会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They… I had a meeting as Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.71,1:10:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们说… - 我的确是凯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They said… - No. I'm definitely Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.54,1:10:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚以凯恩身份见了个人 他也认为我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had a meeting as Kane and he knew me as Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.38,1:10:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我的确是伯恩 也的确是凯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm definitely Bourne. I'm also just definitely Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.34,1:10:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,全跟船有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all just boats.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.71,1:10:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有设计图 摄像机和保安系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got blueprints and cameras and security systems.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.18,1:10:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚查到约翰·凯恩的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just found John Michael Kane's body.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.39,1:10:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在巴黎这里的陈尸所\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a morgue here in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.18,1:10:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你是约翰·凯恩 那么那个尸体到底是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you are John Michael Kane, whose body do they have?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.90,1:11:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再说一遍 什么名字？- 凯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was the name again? - Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.74,1:11:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.86,1:11:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·凯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Michael Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.32,1:11:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·凯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Michael Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.21,1:11:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯恩 是121号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kane. It's number 121.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.33,1:11:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see the body.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.59,1:11:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老板可能会回来 不允许这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our boss could come back. We are not supposed to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.88,1:11:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.77,1:11:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这吗？尸体去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this it? I mean, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.74,1:11:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.07,1:11:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.32,1:11:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙来看那个美国人 但尸体不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy has come to see the American. But the body has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.03,1:11:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他兄弟他们昨晚来过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came yesterday evening…his brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.99,1:11:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有登记\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not in the register.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.54,1:11:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.59,1:11:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里面的尸体哪去了？- 我说过 昨晚有人来过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the body that goes in here? - I said someone came last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.54,1:11:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把尸体弄哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Where'd they take the body?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.25,1:11:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这不是联欢会 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this is not a carnival, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.55,1:12:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都打电话预约 按规章办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}PeopIe call, they make an appointment, follow the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.42,1:12:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里进出都要登记 这儿很严肃 这的工作很严肃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone signs in and out. This is a serious place. Serious work.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.72,1:12:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说你什么时候想来就来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just to come in whenever you like!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.78,1:12:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得对 我们进来时没有登记\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. We didn't sign in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.89,1:12:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.10,1:12:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 我马上就去登记 - 行了 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine. I'm just gonna go sign in. - Okay, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.23,1:12:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.27,1:12:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 慢点 - 你不能动登记\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Slow down - You can't take the book. This is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.90,1:12:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 这有铅笔 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. There's a pencil in here. That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.65,1:12:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你干嘛不去外面等着？就它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, why don't you go wait outside? Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.66,1:12:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't have… Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.92,1:12:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森 刚才怎么回事？你要找什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason, what just happened in there? What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.55,1:12:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼瓦纳·翁博希\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nykwana Wombosi.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.42,1:12:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,翁博希去陈尸所看过凯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wombosi went to the morgue to visit Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.30,1:12:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.60,1:12:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后呢？- 听好 他也出现在联合保安的小册里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - He's in the Alliance brochure.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.06,1:12:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.48,1:12:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道实情\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.51,1:13:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我法语很糟 我不能… 好象是说一艘船或…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My French sucks. I can't…It says something about a boat or…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.52,1:13:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不懂 报上说什么？你看了 告诉我 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. What does it say? You read it. Tell me. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.15,1:13:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,报上说 翁博希在被杀前三周告诉警方…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says that 3 weeks before he was killed, Mr. Wombosi told police…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.15,1:13:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名男子在距马赛八公里的海上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that a man came onto his yacht,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.77,1:13:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬上他的游艇…\N{\fnArial\fs30}five miles off the coast of Marseilles…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.99,1:13:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,并企图暗杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and tried to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.70,1:13:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,报上说 他把那人赶下了船 并击中他后背两枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says that he chased the man off the boat and shot him twice in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.62,1:13:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,报上说我是名刺客\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says I'm an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.33,1:14:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.21,1:14:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你说的是到…我们马上就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no…you said Rue de l… we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.58,1:14:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就停这 这就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just right here, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.38,1:14:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.38,1:14:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.76,1:14:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.84,1:14:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.30,1:14:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 快走 - 怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go. Go. - What are…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.22,1:14:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱给多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave me too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.64,1:14:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们暴露了 快走 - 暴露？暴什么露？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're blown. Come on. - Blown? What is "blown"?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.93,1:14:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 找你零钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur…your change, your change.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.10,1:14:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你不能停这 你必须离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, please…You can't stay here… You have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.61,1:14:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走 继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.40,1:15:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为他们会在那干嘛？在监视饭店\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think they're doing there? They're on to the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.57,1:15:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会 你不知道 - 相信我 继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. You don't know that. - Trust me. Just keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.30,1:15:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了？你这是干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crazy? What are you doing now?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.60,1:15:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.27,1:15:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是暴露\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is blown.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.28,1:15:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛丽？- 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marie? - Get away.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.44,1:15:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛丽 站住 - 离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop right there. - Get away from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.74,1:15:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样？杀我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do? Kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.62,1:15:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛丽 - 下一步就杀我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marie. - Is that next?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.99,1:15:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 镇静 镇静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, stay calm. Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.45,1:15:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我们做什么都要一起做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever we do, we have to do it together.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.75,1:15:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们必须… - 我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to be… - We?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.12,1:15:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有过的唯一共同之处就是我们都不知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing we had in common was that neither of us knew who you were.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.67,1:15:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已熬过来了 听我说！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've passed that now. Listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.50,1:16:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方会找我们的 在大使馆拿到照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police'll find us. The people who took the picture in the embassy…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.01,1:16:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死翁博希的那帮人就要来追杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who killed Wombosi, they're gonna come here and kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.09,1:16:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也在为那帮人干\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people who you work for.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.64,1:16:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带你去你该去的任何地方 我会带你去 我会让你在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take you wherever you need to go. I'll take you there. I'll leave you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.93,1:16:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿做什么就做什么 永远别再见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do what you want. You never have to see me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.69,1:16:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在这不行 我们留在这就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not here. If we stay here, we die.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.36,1:16:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 这些警察真是干得「太棒了」！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, great police work! Really brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.66,1:16:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛不在那挂幅标语 写上「别回来！」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't they just hang out a banner that says, "Don't come back! "
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.50,1:16:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！法语怎么说「监控」二字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ! What is the French word for "stakeout"?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.80,1:16:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事发生在16分钟前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this was 16 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.01,1:16:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就从这开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our starting point.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.35,1:16:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们不能乘飞机火车 妮基？- 我在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't fly, trains are risky. Nicky? - Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.98,1:16:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要知道巴黎那些出色警察的一举一动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know everything Paris's finest is doing on this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.52,1:17:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.02,1:17:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过24小时 但他并没回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said 24 hours, and he's not back.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.24,1:17:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们很清楚他现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But we got a good idea where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.74,1:17:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的这个秘密特工疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a black ops agent who's off the reservation.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.58,1:17:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把美国领事馆毁得一塌糊涂 如今又在欧洲四处逃命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He trashed an American consulate. He's on the run in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.79,1:17:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你还不知原因何在 但我却面对监察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know why. I got to stand before an oversight committee.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.09,1:17:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于踩石行动 我对他们说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will I say about Treadstone?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.75,1:17:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你担心的是预算会议吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're worried about a budget meeting?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.26,1:17:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不负责此事 这事处理不好就难堪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't take care of this, we don't make it to the men's room.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.09,1:17:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在明白了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, is that clear enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.76,1:17:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会毁在这事上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will burn for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.43,1:17:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两个都会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will both of us burn.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.06,1:17:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 分两个组 达尔 雷继续监视电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I want two teams. Daryl, Ray, stay on the grids.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.11,1:17:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,布菜恩 哈里斯 史蒂夫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, Harris, Steve…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.44,1:17:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们追查那个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I want to work on this girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.32,1:17:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 住宅图样进行得怎样？- 已开始做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And this residency pattern? - We started it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.49,1:17:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,做出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.68,1:17:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,参照了她祖母和她同父异母弟弟的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cross-referenced numbers from the grandmother and the stepbrother.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.68,1:17:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现有重合时 就提取号码…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we found convergence, we took the numbers…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.90,1:17:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,往回查\N{\fnArial\fs30}…back-checked them,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.11,1:18:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,结合手头资料一起搜索 虽然线索有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}ran a search merge with other data we had, which wasn't much.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.15,1:18:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这些图钉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pins. These pins.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.73,1:18:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些就是她过去六年住过的所有地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are all the places we think she's lived in the last six years.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.57,1:18:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四 五处\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, four, five.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.73,1:18:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的资料库\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our pool.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.67,1:18:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人接听\N{\fnArial\fs30}No answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.71,1:18:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让铃声响了几下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times you let it ring?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.09,1:18:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要不想去 我就搭便车 - 我说过送你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, if you don't want to go, I'll hitch. - I said I'd take you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.68,1:18:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些就是目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are the targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.13,1:18:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,恳求 讨借 黑客 窃听 迂回 我不在乎你们用何种手段！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beg, borrow, hack, tap, bypass! I don't care what you do!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.55,1:18:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要你们告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know everything you can tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.61,1:18:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些地方发生的所有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}about what's going on at those locations.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.07,1:19:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这房子仍是他的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know he still owns this?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.62,1:19:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃蒙总是有钱 他不会卖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eamon always had money. He would never sell this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.82,1:19:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marie?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.03,1:19:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.95,1:19:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.28,1:19:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.49,1:19:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.16,1:19:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为这儿会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it would…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.25,1:19:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见鬼 是埃蒙 我跟他说 - 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit, that's Eamon. I'll talk to him. - We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.18,1:20:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃蒙 意外吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eamon. Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.01,1:20:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 玛丽 哦 老天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, Marie. Wow, God…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.06,1:20:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这真是对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there's a really good reason for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.44,1:20:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,理由太充分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There bloody well better be.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.10,1:20:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸？- 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daddy! - Hang on. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.98,1:20:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到你会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea you would be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.90,1:20:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会在这？这是我唯一的房子 没错吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why would I be here? It's only my bloody house, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.82,1:20:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.12,1:20:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她带你来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she get you into this?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.62,1:20:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只准备呆一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just gonna be for a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.37,1:20:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 阿兰要撒尿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, Alain has to go pee!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.88,1:20:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 来吧 下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, come on. Here. Get out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.21,1:20:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, in you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.92,1:20:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 阿兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Alain.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.93,1:20:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. l…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.26,1:20:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为会没事的 但我想我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it would be okay. But I guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.10,1:20:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要找妈妈 - 妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's find Mommy. - Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.06,1:20:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈在外面要呆两天 幸好这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy is away for two days, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.15,1:20:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把自己缠上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got yourseIf all tied up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.23,1:21:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.66,1:21:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做什么的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he do for a living?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.58,1:21:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前做航运\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to be in shipping.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.08,1:21:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他适合你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he good for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.00,1:21:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你幸福吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you happy?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.92,1:21:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的 我在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me. I try too hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.49,1:21:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.74,1:21:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡个好觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep well.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.20,1:21:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.41,1:21:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡地板\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll sleep on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.76,1:21:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是几点的事情？- 早上11点45\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This was when? - 11:45 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.26,1:22:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全在从巴黎开车所及的范围之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is definitely within the driving range of Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.76,1:22:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话是从公路南側的路边休息店打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The call came from a highway rest stop, southbound side.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.77,1:22:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这个黄图钉代表什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What's this yellow pin?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.35,1:22:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她1997年在那里呆了几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}She spent two months there in 1997.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.56,1:22:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离最近的镇子是里奥姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closest town is Riom.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.36,1:22:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,从她家的电话记录把国际电话整理出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took her family's phone records and collated the international calls.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.86,1:22:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们凌晨两点时在巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were in Paris at 2.:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.86,1:22:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们无法乘飞机 火车也太危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't fly. The train's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.78,1:22:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他太知道我们会去哪追捕他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows better than to go anywhere we might track him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.91,1:22:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能这样猜测\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is our best guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.93,1:23:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这干嘛？- 看孩子 我担心睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - The kids. I was worried. I couldn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.14,1:23:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会弄醒他们的 我们得离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll wake them up. We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.43,1:23:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不想知道自己是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to know who I am anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.64,1:23:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎 我不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care. I don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.94,1:23:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来，我们谈一谈… - 我查明的任何事 我都想忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. We'll talk about… - Everything I find out I want to forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.03,1:23:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.91,1:23:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎我是谁 或干过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care who I am or what I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.48,1:23:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.81,1:23:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have this money.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.56,1:23:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.57,1:23:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能这样做吗？你有可能这样做吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we do that? Is there any chance you can do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.37,1:24:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.54,1:24:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.01,1:24:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖狗 出来！出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, boy! Here, boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.72,1:24:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.31,1:24:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 你起得够早的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ. You were up early.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.02,1:24:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你煮的咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless you for making coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.36,1:24:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一宿 你们没开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}One night. You weren't kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.33,1:24:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,换换环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a change.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.24,1:24:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not there either.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.88,1:24:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 车的旁边找了吗？- 到处都找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you looked by the car? - He's not anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.68,1:24:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们穿衣服吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let me get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.51,1:24:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？- 狗不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Bloody dog's gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.18,1:25:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事经常发生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that happen a lot?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.85,1:25:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？那狗？早上不吃就跑？从不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? That mutt? Miss his breakfast? Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.39,1:25:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是有原因的 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always something, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.56,1:25:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.48,1:25:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.23,1:25:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快带他们进地下室 - 你在说些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get everyone in the basement right now. - What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.74,1:25:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你家人有危险 我没时间解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in danger. Your family's in danger. I don't have time to explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.24,1:25:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 究竟… - 埃蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait a minute. What… - Eamon.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.33,1:25:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.74,1:25:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你究竟干了什么？- 不是她 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What have you done? - It's not her. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.50,1:25:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须尽快下地下室去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get out of sight and in the basement as quick as you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.38,1:25:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.84,1:25:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.26,1:25:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.36,1:25:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 电话没声 - 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The phone is dead. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.62,1:26:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森 外面是什么人？是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason, who's out there? Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.59,1:26:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.80,1:26:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.14,1:26:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本不该来这 我…两个孩子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should never have come here. l… These children…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.48,1:26:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.80,1:29:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪？武器在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it? Where's the weapon?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.30,1:29:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁在？还有谁？你们有几个人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else is out here? Who else? How many you got with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.47,1:29:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再问第二遍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.97,1:29:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我单干 和你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work alone. Like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.48,1:29:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总是单干\N{\fnArial\fs30}We always work alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.90,1:29:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这话什么意思？- 你是哪儿的？罗马？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean? - Who are you? Rome?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.32,1:29:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是巴黎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paris?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.82,1:29:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两个都参加踩石行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treadstone, both of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.61,1:29:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 踩石？- 是哪的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Treadstone? - Which one?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.32,1:29:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴黎 我住在巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paris. I live in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.08,1:29:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头疼吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get the headaches?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.87,1:29:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.70,1:29:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我头疼得厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get such bad headaches.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.08,1:29:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道晚上开车的感觉吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know at night when you're driving a car?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.54,1:29:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许和开前灯有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's the headlights.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.34,1:29:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,踩石是什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is Treadstone?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.17,1:29:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,踩石行动意味着止疼药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treadstone said pills.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.13,1:29:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫我们去巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said go to Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.22,1:29:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,踩石在巴黎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Treadstone in Paris?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.52,1:29:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.35,1:29:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧他们都让你付出了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at what they make you give.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.26,1:30:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.26,1:30:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳迪娅 你坐前面并系上安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Claudia, get in the front and put your beIt on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.05,1:30:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我把你放在后座\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're gonna put you in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.39,1:30:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳迪娅 坐前面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}AII right, get in the front, Claudia.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.89,1:30:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 我不再等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not waiting, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.19,1:30:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃蒙 再等一等 不等了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}One minute, Eamon. I'm not waiting!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.07,1:30:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.78,1:30:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.07,1:30:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我取出了三万美金 其余都归你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took out $30, 000. The rest is yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.45,1:30:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这样？- 我就这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it? - That's all I got.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.37,1:30:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是这意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.91,1:31:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 不能再拖了 你必须现在就走 离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not gonna stop, Marie. You got to get out now. Away from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.92,1:31:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须离开 赶快逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to get out. You got to start running.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.96,1:31:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要隐藏行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get low, you stay low.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.76,1:31:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再交朋友 要换新环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more friends. Nothing familiar.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.18,1:31:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的钱够你生活 什么生活都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's enough in there for you to make a life. Any life.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.97,1:31:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 我要走了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out of here, Marie!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.43,1:31:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.10,1:31:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车 你必须走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the car. You got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.07,1:31:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.78,1:31:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll end it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.78,1:31:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.74,1:31:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.37,1:32:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,请报代号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code in, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.99,1:33:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,报代号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code in.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.54,1:33:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,报代号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code in.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.05,1:33:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哪位？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.26,1:33:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.73,1:33:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你派来的人已死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man you sent is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.56,1:33:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不管你是谁 你最好开口说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whoever this is, you better start talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.73,1:33:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 杰森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.23,1:33:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你看现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we into now?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.66,1:33:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有两个办法 要么回来处理好这事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It only goes two ways. Either you come in and let us make this right…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.20,1:33:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么只好继续玩下去 直到我们满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or we'll keep going until we're satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.46,1:33:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 直到我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean until you kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.08,1:33:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道问题所在 我没法补救\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't fix this if I don't know what the problem is.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.92,1:33:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我怎么做 我会尽力而为的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what we're into, and I'll do the best I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.60,1:34:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森 你干嘛不和玛丽谈一谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you talk to Marie, Jason?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.81,1:34:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 问问玛丽她的想法是什么 - 说实话 我想她才不在乎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's ask Marie what she wants. - I don't think she gives a shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.48,1:34:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.32,1:34:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真遗憾 是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to hear that. How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.95,1:34:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她拖我后腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was sIowing me down.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.12,1:34:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰森 我们做这些是…- 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All we've been doing right from… - Enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.23,1:34:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.46,1:34:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午五点半\N{\fnArial\fs30}5:30 p.m. Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.97,1:34:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在巴黎新桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today. Pont Neuf.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.97,1:34:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就自己来 走到桥中间位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come alone, you walk to the middle of that bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.51,1:34:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱下外套 面朝东方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take off your jacket. Face east.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.64,1:34:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会再拨这个号码 - 等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll redial this number. - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.82,1:34:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐头班飞机去 告诉妮基我会在车上 给她打电话 叫她找「花边」\N{\fnArial\fs30}First flight out. Tell Nicky I'll call from the car. Tell her to find Picot.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.00,1:34:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.20,1:35:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.16,1:35:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打算怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.83,1:35:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我会把它摆平 我正在做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I'dclean this up. That's what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.21,1:35:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真能把他带回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you really bring him in?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.83,1:35:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事我们不是已说过了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're past that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.34,1:35:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么高见？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a better idea?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.01,1:35:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了从苏黎世到巴黎的一连串破坏…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've given me nothing but a trail of collateral damage…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.84,1:35:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都没干 换我来干肯定比这好\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from Zurich to Paris. I couldn't do much worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.30,1:35:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛不上楼去订一个会议室？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go upstairs and book a conference room?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.18,1:35:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你能说得他俯首听命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can talk him to death.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.59,1:36:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,大巴 观光大巴 顶层\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bus, the tour bus, second level.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.26,1:36:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,于目标无碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative on the target.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.64,1:36:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一号位置？- 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Position one? - Negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.94,1:36:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 二号位置 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Position two? - Negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.12,1:37:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,三号位置 摩托车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Position three, motorcycle.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.75,1:37:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.66,1:37:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.45,1:37:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你独自来 我猜这对你太难办了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to come alone. I guess that was too complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.50,1:37:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就试试这个吧：我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So try this: I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.80,1:37:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.64,1:38:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,接通妮基的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Nicky on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.28,1:38:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.20,1:38:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把房间清理好要多长时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long to wipe down the room and move it?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.83,1:38:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 处理掉所有资料？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get rid of everything? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.50,1:38:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两到三个小时 - 那好 马上干\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two to three hours. - All right, get started.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.38,1:38:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,中间别停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, no breaks.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.80,1:38:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人守外面 一人在大厅 要警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men outside, one in the lobby. And keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.72,1:38:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡车留下？- 对 留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep the truck? - Keep the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.81,1:38:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要关掉这个小组 把设备搬到车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna close this unit down. We'll move the gear in the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.16,1:39:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们负责西班牙 马耳他和摩洛哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were covering Spain, Malta, Morocco.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.00,1:39:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 当地警方的所有无线信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, all local police radio traffic.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.67,1:39:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 动北欧需要总部授权 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, for northern Europe we need an authorized directive. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.34,1:39:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 他们开始干了 我们半小时后收到卫星下传资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, they're on it. We'll have a satellite download in 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.95,1:40:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的行动箱在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your field box?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.87,1:40:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的行动箱在哪？- 就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's your field box? - It's right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.12,1:40:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个系统出故障了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole system's gone haywire.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.13,1:40:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题就在这边的这个窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's this window right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.88,1:40:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,餐厅窗户呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dining room window?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.14,1:40:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.81,1:40:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没信号 电话没信号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead. The phones are dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.81,1:40:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩干的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Bourne, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.31,1:40:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别出声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.24,1:41:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你动就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You move, you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.53,1:41:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.91,1:41:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪扔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun down.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.25,1:41:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}In there.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.04,1:41:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你想干…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so what do you want…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.92,1:42:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,踩石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treadstone.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.88,1:42:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好看看周围 没剩下什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better take a look around. There's not much left.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.47,1:42:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就是踩石？- 我是踩石？我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you Treadstone? - Am I Treadstone? Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.05,1:42:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么鬼话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.14,1:42:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's lost it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.81,1:42:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好马上解释清楚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better start filling in the blanks here!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.70,1:42:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我还以为 我们是一边的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I thought we were on the same side.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.10,1:42:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪边？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose side is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.48,1:42:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道自己都在干什么吗？你什么都不明白！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what you're doing, do you? You don't have a goddamn clue!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.82,1:42:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.23,1:42:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是美国政府的资产\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're U.S. government property!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.28,1:42:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是身价三千万 但却出岔子的一件武器！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a malfunctioning $30 million weapon!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.78,1:42:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你十足是一个祸害！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a total goddamn catastrophe!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.82,1:42:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在老天的份上 你就是杀我也得告诉我 究竟出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, by God, if it kilIs me, you'll tell me how this happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.99,1:42:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为何想要杀我？- 马赛那边出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you trying to kill me? - What happened in Marseilles?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.04,1:42:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你派我去杀翁博希\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent me to kill Wombosi.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.00,1:42:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀翁博希？没错 这事我们随时都能做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill Wombosi? Yeah, we can do that any time we want.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.13,1:42:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以派妮基去做这事 真见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can send Nicky to do that, for Christ's sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.76,1:42:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,翁博希本该在三周前就死掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wombosi was supposed to be dead three weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.63,1:42:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的死本该只有一种解释 那就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was supposed to have died in a way that the only possible explanation was…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.76,1:42:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是被自己的一名随从谋杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that he'd been murdered by a member of his own entourage.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.85,1:42:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会派你去暗杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't send you to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.77,1:42:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我派你躲藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I send you to be invisible.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.48,1:42:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我派你 是因为你这人根本就不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I send you because you don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.94,1:43:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道在马赛出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know what happened in Marseilles.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.15,1:43:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得在马赛发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember what happened in Marseilles.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.19,1:43:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞎扯！战士 这不可接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit! This is unacceptable, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.95,1:43:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗？你失手了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me? You failed!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.70,1:43:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可接受？你失手了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unacceptable? You failed!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.28,1:43:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你失手了 所以你要告诉我原因！- 我没法告诉你！我记不起来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You failed and you're gonna tell me why! - I can't tell you! I don't remember!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.16,1:43:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你激活了凯恩 你安排了与翁博希的见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought Kane to life. You put together a meeting with Wombosi.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.33,1:43:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了保安公司 你闯了进去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found the security company. You broke into the office!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.21,1:43:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 你挑选游艇作为下手地点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Christ's sake, you picked the yacht as the goddamn strike point!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.72,1:43:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选了游艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You picked the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.27,1:43:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选了日子 你跟踪船员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You picked the day. You tracked the crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.14,1:43:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物 燃料！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The food, the fuel!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.81,1:43:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把地点 时间告诉了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told us where. You told us when.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.15,1:43:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那船上藏了五天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hid out on that boat five days.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.82,1:43:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你参与了 杰森 你参与了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in, Jason. You were in!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.49,1:43:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它结束了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was over!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.63,1:44:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你记得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you do remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.43,1:44:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.06,1:45:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再干这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to do this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.31,1:45:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这不是你能决定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that's a decision you can make.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.16,1:45:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森·伯恩死了 听见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason Bourne is dead. Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.83,1:45:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他两周前淹死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drowned two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.66,1:45:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要告诉他们伯恩死了 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna go tell them Bourne is dead. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.58,1:45:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.04,1:45:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 只要我觉得有人跟踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, if I even feel somebody behind me,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.40,1:45:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会不顾一切地…\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is no measure to how fast…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.17,1:45:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把战火烧到你家门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and how hard I will bring this fight to your doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.30,1:45:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是自己一边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my own side now.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.01,1:49:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.81,1:49:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.60,1:49:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,踩石行动项目实际上已被终止\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Treadstone project has already been terminated.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.52,1:49:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,本是想把它设计成一种高级行动方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was designed primarily as a sort of advanced game program.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.81,1:49:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能把它变成一个出色的训练平台\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd hoped it might build into a good training platform.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.61,1:50:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 对一项纯理论训练而言…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But quite honestly, for a strictly theoretical exercise…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.28,1:50:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个代价也太高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the cost-benefit ratio was just too high.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.70,1:50:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,该项目到此被全部取消\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all but decommissioned at this point.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.87,1:50:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 下面是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.53,1:50:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.50,1:50:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑荆棘项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Blackbriar.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.79,1:50:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑荆棘是和国防部联合实施的通讯项目…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blackbriar is a joint DOD communications program…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.08,1:50:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的觉得该项目很有吸引力 它成功的可能性很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that we really feel has good traction to it. It's got legs. It'll run and run.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.59,1:50:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它融合了安全领域预防和反应的诸多因素…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It combines elements of proactive and reactive fields of security…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.01,1:51:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的店？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This your store?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.72,1:51:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.31,1:51:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,店不错 就是难找 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice. It's a little hard to find, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.94,1:51:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以租一辆摩托吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I could rent a scooter?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.86,1:51:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有身份证吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have ID?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.78,1:51:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,算不上有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
